  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It would be nice for VRChat to provide the ID of avatars that are unpacked in the logs. \n\nThis is how unpacked avatars are currently shown in the logs:\n\n[AssetBundleDownloadManager] [***] Unpacking Avatar (VRRat by Creator Support)\n\nWith my request, it would look like this:\n\n[AssetBundleDownloadManager] [***] Unpacking Avatar (VRRat by Creator Support) (avtr_26187637-0c30-4a09-86e1-bc928c07309e)\n\nWhy? It could help to find public avatars, such as fallback crashers, which tend to be the last line showing the unpacked avatars in the log before the crash to report them to the Trust & Safety Team.",
